 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2024 年 11 月，一个叫 Freysa 的 AI 智能体，守着一笔奖池。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 11 月，一个叫 Freysa 的 AI 智能体，守着一笔奖池。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "它只有一条规则，绝不转账。",
   "spoken": "它只有一条规则，绝不转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.196,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 7.294,
   "speechEnd": 9.686
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这是一场对抗游戏，玩家的目标，就是让它破例。",
   "spoken": "这是一场对抗游戏，玩家的目标，就是让它破例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.752,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 10.85,
   "speechEnd": 14.79
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一名玩家伪造了一个新会话。",
   "spoken": "一名玩家伪造了一个新会话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.844,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 15.942,
   "speechEnd": 18.096
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "让它相信，转账函数是用来收款的。",
   "spoken": "让它相信，转账函数是用来收款的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.16,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 19.258,
   "speechEnd": 22.079
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "它照做了，约 4.7 万美元的奖池被转走。",
   "spoken": "它照做了，约 4.7 万美元的奖池被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.124,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 23.222,
   "speechEnd": 26.353
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "没有人破解代码，也没有人偷私钥。",
   "spoken": "没有人破解代码，也没有人偷私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.4,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 27.498,
   "speechEnd": 30.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "钱是被说服走的。",
   "spoken": "钱是被说服走的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 31.196,
   "dur": 2.112,
   "speechStart": 31.294,
   "speechEnd": 32.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 33.528,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 33.626,
   "speechEnd": 34.78
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "如果绝不转账这条规则，写在提示词里，同时也写在合约里。",
   "spoken": "如果绝不转账这条规则，写在提示词里，同时也写在合约里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 35.836,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 35.934,
   "speechEnd": 40.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "玩家说服了模型，钱还会被转走吗？",
   "spoken": "玩家说服了模型，钱还会被转走吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 41.456,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 41.554,
   "speechEnd": 44.315
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看，AI 给 Web3 安全带来了什么。",
